  "mcpName": "io.github.fpavia111-creator/fairclinic-claims-aging",
  "description": "Fairclinic Claims Aging: dental insurance claims still unpaid, aged by date sent, with follow-up dates, timely-filing risk, unsent and duplicate claims, and a payer follow-up letter for one named person to send. Patient names are masked before results reach the model.",
